.TH "nvme_init_set_features_ns_metadata" 9 "nvme_init_set_features_ns_metadata" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_set_features_ns_metadata \- Initialize passthru command for Namespace Metadata
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_set_features_ns_metadata
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "bool sv "  ","
.BI "__u8 ea "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_host_metadata *data "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sv" 12
Save value across power states
.IP "ea" 12
Element Action (EA), see \fIenum nvme_host_metadata_ea\fP
.IP "data" 12
Host Metadata data buffer, see \fIstruct nvme_host_metadata\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Set Features command with
FID value NVME_FEAT_FID_NS_METADATA
